WEBVTT

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.560
The harbor district is being sealed off.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.700
Situation reported to all relevant ministries.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.160
All neighboring marine and sky areas have been sealed off.

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:29.660
He's a renegade to begin with.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.370
We have no choice but to dispose of him.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.740
Right, Satsuma?

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.390
Where is Raptor-1 now?

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:37.670
Currently heading towards B-01 in the harbor area.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.360
Send Yoshino.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:43.230
The only ones who can keep Digimon under control...

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.960
are Digimon!

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.920
<i>An unexploded bomb has been discovered in this harbor area.</i>

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:55.050
<i>As removal attempts are ongoing, all citizens are please asked to find shelter at once.</i>

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:56.260
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:59.140
<i>All citizens are pleased asked to find shelter at once.</i>

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.090
Hey, wait!

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.470
Fujieda from DATS.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:01.350
How's the evacuation?

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:05.110
Oh, everything south of here has been vacated.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:05.740
Yoshino!

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:07.640
What is it?

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:11.110
I sense life signals 500 meters ahead.

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:12.320
Is it Raptor-1?

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:13.570
No. Humans.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.070
There are 15 in total.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:19.870
This is the worst!

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:23.840
How awful!

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.090
This is Yoshino.

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:28.620
We have victims. They need a hospital right away...

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:29.250
Yoshino!

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.380
It's Raptor-1!

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:42.470
Who the hell do you think you are, getting in the way of my fight?

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:49.570
I don't know who you are, but nobody's allowed to invade on <i>my</i>  turf!

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:54.070
I'm the number one street fighter in Japan, Daimon Masaru-sama!

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:57.030
NOTE: Using <i>-sama</i> (様) on yourself shows arrogance.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.990
Is he... picking a fight on a Digimon?

00:01:57.370 --> 00:01:58.490
Shut up!

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.990
You're all talk!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.700
You're really full of yourself, for a stupid human!

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.990
He's even talking back at him!

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:07.160
More like, he's taking up the battle offer...

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.170
Quit it with that big ugly mug!

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:12.630
I was born this way!

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:13.510
Yoshino!

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:14.090
Sir!

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:17.590
Get that civilian away from Raptor-1 immediately!

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.420
He's too dangerous.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.770
Hey, you! Get away from him!

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:27.720
You'll only lose if you fight him!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.370
This isn't about win-or-lose!

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.230
This is about fighting man-to-man!

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.110
Yeah! It's man-to-man!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.070
Got it? Now stay out of this!

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:41.890
O-Okay!

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.870
Yoshino, you can't back down on him!

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.070
O-Oh, right.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.040
I see you're pretty brave.

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:49.190
Come on!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.000
Right!

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:03.800
No way!

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:06.270
Who would normally hit the thing?!

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:08.480
What is going on here?

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.590
I am Masaru<i>!</i>

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.590
Cockatrimon Attacks

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.150
I am Masaru!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.590
Cockatrimon Attacks!

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.690
I wasn't ready.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.110
But you won't get me this time!

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:40.900
I see right through your punch!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:42.370
Look out!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.860
See right through it, eh?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:50.630
You dirty...!

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.200
Take <i>that</i> !

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:55.450
That hurt, you bastard!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.890
He's dealing damage to a Digimon bare-handedly...

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:08.480
Just who is this boy?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:19.340
Well fought...

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.250
You threw some pretty good punches yourself...

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:34.870
I'm Agumon.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:37.580
Daimon Masaru.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:44.130
NOTE: <i>Aniki</i> (兄貴) means brother or boss with a family-like connotation. It is often used by gangs and yakuza.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:41.320
Nice to meet you, Masaru-aniki!

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:43.550
Aniki?

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:44.790
Yeah!

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:50.160
You're the first person to acknowledge me as a full-fledged individual, Aniki.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:53.010
That's why, from now on, I'll be your follower!

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:59.210
<i>{kobun}</i> {(子分) literally means "adopted child," a follower who gives unquestioning loyalty to his boss, who in return provides protection and good counsel. Also has yakuza connotations}

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.100
Follower, huh?

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:59.090
You're a pretty weird-looking guy, but I guess that's okay.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:00.980
Hold that thought!

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:04.540
Lalamon!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:05.280
Realize!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:12.630
La~la~mon!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.040
Something came out!

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:17.540
Now, why don't you come with us quietly?

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.530
Who the hell are they?

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.360
They're here to capture me.

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:25.310
If they get me, they'll get rid of me!

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:26.210
What?

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.130
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.410
It's an aniki's job to look after his follower!

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.600
I'm not handing him over to you!

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:37.700
Yay, Aniki!

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.220
Hey, wait up!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.180
Nuts Shoot!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.310
Aniki! Let me handle this!

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:51.360
No way...

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:53.780
Baby Flame!

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.030
Nuts Shoot!

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:01.150
Yoshino!

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:07.570
Oh no!

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.470
<b>Closed for Today</b>

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:18.010
This entire thing's turned into a huge uproar!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.980
Yeah, caused by you!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.480
What are you, anyway?

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:24.480
Where'd you come from?

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:26.940
I dunno.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:30.400
I've always been in the institution.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:31.570
Institution?

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:33.850
I don't want to go back there anymore...

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.530
I really don't get it...

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:42.460
But since I've come this far, I'll help you out somehow.

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:43.180
Aniki!

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.420
Aniki! Thank you, Aniki!

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:49.830
A-Aniki... I'm hungry...!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:51.990
Suck it up for a while!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.220
I can't!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.580
Gimme something to eat!

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.690
Hey, keep it down, someone's gonna hear you!

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:02.180
My stomach's caving in...

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.460
You bastard,you just tried to eat me!!

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:16.570
Sorry, Aniki!

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:19.660
You just looked so tasty, I couldn't help myself...

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.460
No choice then.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:24.630
I'll go get something, so wait here.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:27.080
Aniki!

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:29.380
Listen up!

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:30.780
Don't move from that spot!

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.460
Okay!

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:33.600
I'll wait right here!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.220
He's gotta be able to eat something out of this.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:43.730
This too, please.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:48.270
That's okay with you, right, Daimon Masaru-kun?

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:49.900
NOTE: <i>-kun</i> (君) is typically used to address young males or to those of a lower status.

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:53.860
Lovely!

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:56.410
Eating coffee jelly outside is the best!

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:57.760
Pay me back for that.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:02.660
I will, if you tell me where Raptor-1 is.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:05.630
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:10.170
I don't know anyone with that name! And even if I did, there's no way I'd tell you!

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:11.420
Oh, really?

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:16.130
Then you'll just have to come with me as a material witness, Daimon Masaru-kun.

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.590
How d'you know my name?

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:22.810
You yelled it out earlier for everyone to hear.

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:27.480
Daimon Masaru: 14 years old and born on April 2nd. Blood type B.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:31.220
Currently a 2nd year student attending Ootori Municipal Junior High School.

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:36.850
Your father disappeared 10 years ago and now you live with your mother and little sister.

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.000
Who <i>are</i>  you?

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:44.490
Digital Accident Tactics Squad.

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:46.040
I'm Fujieda Yoshino of DATS.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:49.500
What's that?

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:56.460
Our job as DATS is to keep Digimon, unknown beings who come here from the Digital World, under control.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:59.700
So? What's that DA-something have to do with me?

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:05.350
Like I already said! That Raptor-1 you're sheltering is a Digimon that's escaped from DATS!

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:07.480
I've come to take him back.

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:10.020
He wasn't a frog?

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:12.980
Whoever heard of a talking frog?

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.430
Anyway, Digimon don't eat this stuff!

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:18.490
They only eat food made especially for Digimon.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.700
Who sells that?

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.960
It's not sold anywhere!

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:25.370
You can only get it at DATS. Understand?

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:29.830
As long as you keep running from DATS, Raptor-1 will only starve to death.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:40.720
Sorry, but can you take me to this DATS place?

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:42.510
You...

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.100
What is this place?

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.570
Fujieda Yoshino, reporting back.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:57.840
So you're Daimon Masaru.

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:00.740
I am Captain Satsuma.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.200
Welcome to DATS.

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:11.580
This is the boy that put Raptor-1 under control?

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:14.670
He doesn't appear to have any special power, at any rate.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.130
What's that scarf thing?

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.630
This is Kudamon, my partner.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:24.740
All of DATS's members have their own Digimon partner.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:27.530
This one is Lalamon, my partner.

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:29.810
Partner?

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:30.480
Yes.

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:36.270
Here, we humans and Digimon work together to handle Digimon crimes.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.460
That's a Digimon, too?

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:44.210
Anyway, whatever.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:49.600
There's someone who's hungry and waiting for me to get back, so enough jabbering.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.710
Just hand over what I came for!

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:52.160
Don't get so worked up.

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:55.130
Whether Raptor-1 can be saved or not depends on you!

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:59.050
We are currently in the midst of an unprecedented crisis.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:03.880
The barrier between the human world and the Digital World is starting to collapse.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:04.920
We don't know what's causing it.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:10.100
But, the fact is that Digimon are appearing more frequently in our world.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.230
The Digital World and human world...

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.960
To maintain harmony between these two worlds...

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:18.150
renegades like Raptor-1 must be kept under control.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:19.950
Renegades?

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:20.870
Yes.

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:25.990
Raptor-1 has already entered the human world and injured humans.

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:27.320
It cannot be allowed to go free.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.740
Daimon Masaru, you should work with us...

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.700
to create a bright future for both humans and Digimon!

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.210
No thanks.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.380
What?

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:40.000
What the hell is this?

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.590
Stop pestering without even listening to what I have to say first!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:50.010
I dunno about this harmony business, but have you even considered why he suddenly showed up in this world?

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:52.470
He admired this place!

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:57.980
He admired this wide world, filled with things moving around that he'd never seen before.

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:01.440
So I have no intention of handing him over.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:05.280
But if he starts rampaging, then I'll be responsible.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.230
Isn't that enough?

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:08.090
Now come on, give me his food!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:14.040
Captain! A Digimon is detected in Area D-59!

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:18.000
A hamburger shop in a parking area is being attacked by an unknown creature!

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:19.690
Is it Raptor-1?

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.960
Hold it! Didn't you say he eats nothing but special food?

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:24.820
Why would he attack a hamburger shop?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.910
Because you didn't let him eat anything!

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:31.010
You think he's attacking out of hunger?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.930
It appears you'll have to take responsibility sooner than you thought.

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:37.890
Hey, you...!

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.370
Yoshino, go after him!

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:40.090
Understood!

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:42.980
The rest of you, seal off the area!

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:44.480
Proceed to first-class emergency procedures!

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:44.970
Roger!

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.450
No way...

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:51.530
Where did you go?

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.950
Stop hiding and come on out, Agumon!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.370
So this is where you were hiding him.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:01.830
Since he's nowhere to be seen, it must be him who attacked the hamburger shop...

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:02.440
No!

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:04.630
<i>Listen up!</i>

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.300
<i>Don't move from that spot!</i>

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.320
<i>Okay, I'll wait right here!</i>

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.110
This is my fault.

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.970
I didn't stay with him...

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:24.310
The Digimon signal is in harbor area B-05! Please hurry there!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:25.370
Understood.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.200
There's nothing else for you to do.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.650
It's dangerous, so leave the rest to us and...

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.200
Hey, wait up!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:37.710
This is the worst!

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.020
Stop it!

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:46.450
Agumon!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:47.770
Agumon!!

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.730
Aniki!

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:51.800
Agumon?

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:53.780
Aniki! Aniki!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.300
Aniki! Aniki!

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:56.880
Aniki...!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.220
What were you doing?

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.430
Ah, sorry!

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:04.610
I thought I'd find food in there, but then my head got stuck!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.690
Then, who's that?

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:09.750
Hurry, Yoshino!

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.700
There are two Digimon signals now!

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.160
What's going on?

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:25.540
Checking up on the data.

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:26.460
It's Cockatrimon!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.060
An Adult Level, Bird type Digimon.

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:32.230
He was the one who attacked the hamburger shop...

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:39.550
Aniki!

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:40.970
Who is that guy?

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:42.970
I don't know.

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:48.480
But I <i>do</i>  know that because of him, you were falsely accused!

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:49.410
Aniki...

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:50.480
Let's go, Agumon!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.050
Right!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.150
Baby Flame!

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:04.830
Baby Flame!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.920
Baby Flame!

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:11.200
Raptor-1 is fighting Cockatrimon?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.630
What's the meaning of this?

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:14.880
Raptor-1 has never let himself get close to a human before.

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:16.090
That boy...

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:19.040
He's fighting together with a Digimon...

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.270
Agumon!

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:23.650
Are you okay?!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.200
Aniki!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:28.570
He's really strong...!

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:32.990
Doesn't that fire you up?!

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:36.310
Y...eah!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.990
Don't be stupid, run away!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.830
You'll both die!

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:46.840
When you're in a man's fight, you're already risking your life!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:52.660
The moment you get scared of dying is the exact moment you've lost the fight!

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.180
You've got it, Aniki!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:00.530
Look out!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:12.270
Agumon!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:16.240
Agumon!

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:20.490
Agumon!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:21.680
Agumon!

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.370
Agumon!!!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.630
Raptor-1 is... silent!

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.120
Agumon...

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:44.310
You...

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.440
How dare you hurt my follower!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:16.140
Take that!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.450
What's this?!

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.260
Hey, kid!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:25.210
Use this.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:29.350
What's this?

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:30.720
That's a Digivice.

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:35.190
Use the Digisoul in your fist to charge it.

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:39.560
Once you do that, you can make your Agumon evolve.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:40.810
Evolve?

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:42.740
What's that mean?

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:46.000
Your power will revive Agumon.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:58.800
Digisoul Charge!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:08.100
Agumon's Digisoul is charging up rapidly!

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:09.100
It's reaching critical pressure!

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:10.450
Unbelievable... could this be...?

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:15.000
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:15.000
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:11.100
Unbelievable... could this be...?

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:13.120
Agumon, evolve!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:19.960
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:19.960
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.070
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.070
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:25.690
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:25.690
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:30.500
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:30.500
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.080
GeoGreymon!

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.460
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.460
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:33.790
He transformed?

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:37.750
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:37.750
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:43.020
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:43.020
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:48.820
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:48.820
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:54.990
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:54.990
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.060
Mega Flame!

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:06.450
Whoa!

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.500
That's just what I expect from my follower!

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:10.200
Huh?

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.740
Aniki!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.540
I'm hungry!

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:14.850
What the hell...

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.000
That's so anti-climatic...

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.610
Cockatrimon has been dealt with!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.150
He's been returned to a Digiegg!

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.120
Whoo-hoo!

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.630
Call Yoshino back right away!

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:28.600
What are you thinking, Satsuma?

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:33.600
Not only was he able to connect with a Digimon, but he even got to the point of making him evolve...

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.570
I want that boy on my team at all costs!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:44.200
Aniki, I can't hold out much longer!

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.680
Please give me something to eat!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:47.110
Yeah, got it.

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:48.960
How about going for a hamburger?

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:51.350
Does that taste good?

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.010
Who was that old guy anyway?

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:54.560
Um... Aniki.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:56.480
Yeah, it's great!

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.170
All right!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:58.690
Hey, hold on!

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:03.590
It's true that another Digimon attacked the hamburger shop...

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:08.900
But that one's already injured 13 students!

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.460
That can't be overlooked!

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:14.600
Sorry! That was me who did that!

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.600
They were punks from the next town.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:21.320
Apparently they didn't like something about me, so they called me out... but I beat 'em at their own game!

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:24.750
Teaching those guys a lesson is no sweat for Aniki!

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:25.570
That's right!

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.950
This is the worst...

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.380
I'll arrest you, too!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.730
Run for it, Agumon!

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:33.840
Wait up, Aniki!

